        "_id": "before0000000000",
        "type": "base",
        "description": "<p>Lord Syuul sends out a psionic burst to completely overpower his greatest threats. He makes a <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Reason test</span></strong></span> (2d10 + 4).</p><dl class=\"power-roll-display\"><dt class=\"tier1\"><p>!</p></dt><dd><p>Lord Syuul has [[/apply G3pmIisK48BtlWbz]]{damage weakness 5}.</p></dd><dt class=\"tier2\"><p>@</p></dt><dd><p>Lord Syuul has [[/apply jYSbHU5vWJKVYLb1]]{damage immunity 2}.</p></dd><dt class=\"tier3\"><p>#</p></dt><dd><p>Lord Syuul has [[/apply dablVHoMkSQAjH4U]]{damage immunity 5}.</p></dd></dl><p>Once per round as a maneuver, Lord Syuul can repeat this test, replacing the previous Overpower effect.</p><p>Whenever an Overpower effect is active, any hero who has one or more psionic abilities can use a maneuver to push back by making a <strong>Reason test</strong>, replacing the previous Overpower effect.</p><dl class=\"power-roll-display\"><dt class=\"tier1\"><p>!</p></dt><dd><p>Lord Syuul has [[/apply dablVHoMkSQAjH4U]]{damage immunity 5}.</p></dd><dt class=\"tier2\"><p>@</p></dt><dd><p>Lord Syuul has [[/apply jYSbHU5vWJKVYLb1]]{damage immunity 2}.</p></dd><dt class=\"tier3\"><p>#</p></dt><dd><p>Lord Syuul has [[/apply G3pmIisK48BtlWbz]]{damage weakness 5}.</p></dd></dl><p>The Overpower effect lasts until the end of the encounter.</p>",
